course: dictionary
lesson: 11362
title: Ab, a short word with many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Ab is a very short word, and it can mean different things. The words around it are its context, and they tell you which meaning fits. «Mia does crunches every morning to strengthen her abs.» Crunches are exercises for the tummy, so abs must mean the stomach muscles.
explain: «The nurse checked my blood and said, "You are type AB."» Blood is the clue here, so AB is a blood group. Short words in capital letters, like AB, are often abbreviations. An abbreviation is a short form of a longer name.
explain: Ab can also be a Latin word. «Ab initio» means from the beginning, and ab means from. Always ask: what meaning fits this sentence? Then try your meaning in the sentence and see if it still makes sense.
fact: An ab is one of the stomach muscles; people usually say «abs», short for «abdominal muscles».
fact: «Abs» is an informal word, which means it is the everyday word people use when they talk, not a formal word.
fact: AB is a blood group, as in «type AB».
fact: AB can be an abbreviation: in Canadian addresses it stands for Alberta, and on ships it can stand for «able seaman».
fact: The Latin word «ab» means «from», as in «ab initio», which means from the beginning.
exercise: «Mia does crunches every morning to strengthen her abs.» What are abs? | *The stomach muscles | The bones in your legs | A type of football boot | The sound a drum makes
exercise: «The nurse said, "Your blood type is AB."» In this sentence, AB is a | town in Canada | kind of sandwich | *blood group | school subject
exercise: «The letter was addressed to Calgary, Alberta, AB.» What does AB stand for in this address? | Abdominal muscles | *Alberta | Able seaman | Blood group
test: In the Latin phrase «ab initio», what does ab mean? | before | into | *from | under
test: «The sailor on the ship was an AB.» What can AB stand for here? | Abdominal muscles | Blood group | Alberta | *Able seaman
exam: Coach says, «Do ten ab exercises now.» What are ab exercises for? | Learning Latin words | Cooling down the blood | Writing a postal address | *Strengthening the stomach muscles
